I am outside the airport.
There is a taxi here.
It is a kaali-peeli taxi.
My bags are in the taxi.
I also sit in the taxi.
I say to the driver, "Hello."
My new address is on the mobile phone.
I show the mobile phone.
He reads the address.
He nods.
The taxi sets off.
The driver asks, "Madam, are you a tourist?"
I say, "No, I am not a tourist."
"I am a software engineer."
"I am here for work."
The driver says, "Great."
"Where are you from?"
I say, "I am from Mexico."
It is night now.
Mumbai is a massive city.
